  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "0LoJd4nHm7qoUAuqIfIXUNCOJBw=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-20T10:34:15.154Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The assessment records construction as sufficiently decentralized with standardization, with \"BIM / IFC as the primary symptoms\", able to help establish PMF, holding companion software in the IFC ecosystem and Speckle, and with Powerhouse \"well connected\". Then: \"lacks established consultancy market\".\n\nThat single miss is decisive under the stated criteria, because the whole revenue path runs through consultancies as the channel. Strong technical fit plus existing relationships does not compensate for having no one to sell through.\n\nIt is the clearest illustration of why the criteria are a conjunction rather than a score. A weighted ranking would likely have placed construction first.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-20T10:34:15.154050Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-20T10:34:15.154055Z"
    }
  },
